# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in. Only `npm run figma:pull`, `figma:diff`
# and `figma:visual` read this; nothing else in the build touches it.
#
# Figma personal access token — https://www.figma.com/developers/api#access-tokens
# Settings → Security → Personal access tokens → Generate new token.
# Scopes: file_content:read, file_variables:read (variables need an Enterprise plan;
# without it the components, properties, bindings and geometry still pull fine).
FIGMA_TOKEN=
